# World 7 map - Machine Works. G major, straight and mechanical: the "Hop Along" hook quoted in major on a
# staccato snap lead (bars 1-2, 5-6: D G . B . D B G | E . D B~), xylophone answering in the gaps like meshing
# gears, robotic repeated 16ths, a 16th-note pulse ostinato, slap-bass octaves, cowbell/woodblock/rim clanks,
# and the Mario cadence Eb - F - G in the second half.
# 16-bar loop:  G Em C D | G E7 Am D7 | Eb F G G | C C#dim7 G/D D7
tempo 132
title Gearbox Junction
echo 4 30 22
swing 50

# ---------------- C1: snap lead ----------------
C1: @snaplead v12 p0 q4 E1
C1: L
C1: o4 d8 g8 r8 b8 r8 o5 d8 o4 b8 g8 | o5 e4 d8 o4 b8 ^4 g8 a8 |
C1: o4 b8 o5 c8 r8 e8 r8 g8 e8 c8 | o5 d4 a8 f+8 ^4 r8 o4 d8 |
C1: o4 d8 g8 r8 b8 r8 o5 d8 o4 b8 g8 | o5 e4 d8 o4 b8 ^4 g+8 b8 |
C1: o5 c8 e8 r8 a8 r8 e8 c8 o4 a8 | o5 d16 d16 r8 f+16 f+16 r8 a16 a16 r8 o6 c8 r8 |
C1: o5 e-8 e-16 e-16 g8 b-8 ^4 g8 e-8 | o5 f8 f16 f16 a8 o6 c8 ^4 o5 a8 f8 |
C1: o5 g8 g16 g16 b8 o6 d8 ^4 o5 b8 g8 | o6 d16 c16 o5 b16 a16 g8 r8 d8 r8 g4 |
C1: o5 e8 r8 e8 g8 o6 c8 r8 o5 g8 e8 | o5 e8 r8 e8 g8 a+8 r8 g8 e8 |
C1: o5 d8 g8 b8 o6 d8 ^4 o5 b8 g8 | o5 a8 r8 f+8 r8 d8 r8 o4 a8 r8 |

# ---------------- C2: xylophone answers / thirds ----------------
C2: @xylo v10 p-4 q4 E1
C2: L
C2: r1 | r2 o5 g16 f+16 e16 d16 r4 | r1 | r2 o5 f+16 e16 d16 c+16 r4 |
C2: r1 | r2 o5 g+16 f+16 e16 d16 r4 | r1 | r8 o4 a8 r8 o5 d8 r8 f+8 r8 a8 |
C2: o4 b-8 b-16 b-16 o5 e-8 g8 ^4 e-8 o4 b-8 | o5 c8 c16 c16 f8 a8 ^4 f8 c8 |
C2: o5 d8 d16 d16 g8 b8 ^4 g8 d8 | r4 r8 o5 b8 r8 g8 d4 |
C2: o5 c8 r8 c8 e8 g8 r8 e8 c8 | o5 c+8 r8 c+8 e8 g8 r8 e8 c+8 |
C2: o4 b8 o5 d8 g8 b8 ^4 g8 d8 | r8 o5 f+8 r8 d8 r8 o4 a8 r8 f+8 |

# ---------------- C3: synth pad (low) ----------------
C3: @pad v6 p4 q8 E1
C3: L
C3: o3 {g b > d}1 | o3 {g b > e}1 | o3 {g > c e}1 | o3 {f+ a > d}1 |
C3: o3 {g b > d}1 | o3 {g+ b > d}1 | o3 {a > c e}1 | o3 {f+ a > c}1 |
C3: o3 {g b- > e-}1 | o3 {a > c f}1 | o3 {g b > d}1 | o3 {g b > d}1 |
C3: o3 {g > c e}1 | o3 {g a+ > c+}1 | o3 {g b > d}1 | o3 {f+ a > c}1 |

# ---------------- C4: gear ostinato ----------------
C4: @pulse v6 p5 q4 E1
C4: L
C4: o4 [d16 g16 b16 g16]4 | o4 [e16 g16 b16 g16]4 | o4 [e16 g16 > c16 < g16]4 | o4 [d16 f+16 a16 f+16]4 |
C4: o4 [d16 g16 b16 g16]4 | o4 [d16 g+16 b16 g+16]4 | o4 [e16 a16 > c16 < a16]4 | o4 [c16 f+16 a16 f+16]4 |
C4: o4 [e-16 g16 b-16 g16]4 | o4 [c16 f16 a16 f16]4 | o4 [d16 g16 b16 g16]4 | o4 [d16 g16 b16 g16]4 |
C4: o4 [e16 g16 > c16 < g16]4 | o4 [c+16 e16 g16 e16]4 | o4 [d16 g16 b16 g16]4 | o4 [c16 f+16 a16 f+16]4 |

# ---------------- C5: slap-bass octaves ----------------
C5: @slapbass v12 p0 q5 E0
C5: L
C5: o1 [g8 > g8 <]4 | o2 [e8 > e8 <]4 | o2 [c8 > c8 <]4 | o2 [d8 > d8 <]4 |
C5: o1 [g8 > g8 <]4 | o2 [e8 > e8 <]4 | o1 [a8 > a8 <]4 | o2 [d8 > d8 <]4 |
C5: o2 [e-8 > e-8 <]4 | o2 [f8 > f8 <]4 | o1 [g8 > g8 <]4 | o1 [g8 > g8 <]4 |
C5: o2 [c8 > c8 <]4 | o2 [c+8 > c+8 <]4 | o2 [d8 > d8 <]4 | o2 [d8 > d8 <]2 c8 d8 e8 f+8 |

# ---------------- C6: kick / snare ----------------
C6: @kit v11
C6: L
C6: [[k8 r16 k16 s8 r8 k8 k8 s8 r8]7 k8 r16 k16 s8 r8 s16 s16 s16 s16 t8 t8]2 |

# ---------------- C7: clank (hats, cowbell, woodblock, rim) ----------------
C7: @kit v8
C7: L
C7: c8 h16 h16 a8 h16 h16 i8 d8 a8 h8 | [h8 h16 h16 a8 h16 h16 i8 d8 a8 h8]15 |

# ---------------- C8: glockenspiel ticks ----------------
C8: @glock v6 p6 q6 E1
C8: L
C8: r2. o6 d16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 e16 r16 b16 r16 | r2. o6 e16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 d16 r16 a16 r16 |
C8: r2. o6 d16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 e16 r16 g+16 r16 | r2. o6 c16 r16 a16 r16 | r2 o6 a16 r16 f+16 r16 d16 r16 c16 r16 |
C8: r2. o6 e-16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 f16 r16 a16 r16 | r2. o6 d16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 b16 r16 g16 r16 |
C8: r2. o6 e16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 c+16 r16 g16 r16 | r2. o6 d16 r16 g16 r16 | r2 o6 a16 r16 f+16 r16 d16 r16 c16 r16 |
